#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:5 d792ede7d1cc4db89fbd2aafd80a0165
msgid "Automatic Flaps"
msgstr "自动襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:7 077177315a2b46dfa19cc829d5d813cf
msgid ""
"Plane can automatically control flaps in both manual throttle and autonomous"
" modes based on an airspeed schedule and/or during autotakeoffs and "
"landings. Simply put you can specify two speeds and two flap settings."
msgstr "Plane 可以在手动油门和自主模式下根据空速计划，和/或在自动起飞与降落期间，自动控制襟翼。简单来说，您可以指定两个速度和两个襟翼设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:10 1f4e47f38fba41f9b9a1551bdbb214bb
msgid ""
"Two modes of operation are available depending on whether bit 15 of the "
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bit is set:"
msgstr "根据 :ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 的第 15 位是否置位，有两种工作方式："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:13 046b90aa9ebb4e328f5f820fb3326cae
msgid ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bit \"15\" clear"
msgstr ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 第 \"15\" 位清零"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:14 2d370164264d4c2193db23f6484774ac
msgid ""
"If your target speed (not your actual speed) is above the specified speeds "
"then your flaps are set to the default (trim) position. If your target speed"
" is lowered below the first flap speed, then flaps are deployed to the first"
" position, and if your target speed is lowered below the second flap speed, "
"then flaps are deployed to the second position."
msgstr ""
"如果目标速度（而非实际速度）高于指定速度，则襟翼设置为默认（配平）位置。如果目标速度降至第一襟翼速度以下，则襟翼展开到第一位置；如果目标速度降至第二襟翼速度以下，则襟翼展开到第二位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:21 8d30e5b458b34ef98929aca73a62c280
msgid ""
"The target speed can be commanded by changing the value of cruise_speed in "
"the parameter interface, by using the Do_Set_Speed command in a mission, or "
"by the throttle stick position in FBW-B."
msgstr ""
"目标速度可通过在参数界面更改 cruise_speed 值、在任务中使用 Do_Set_Speed 命令或在 FBW-B 模式下通过油门摇杆位置来指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:26 dc4a0af5ca784037bf1db3bc7c23e877
msgid ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` bit 15 set"
msgstr ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 第 15 位置位"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:27 186d289d09114fa6a74a5f104a747e4a
msgid ""
"In manual throttle modes actual airspeed (or estimate) is used for flaps "
"activation"
msgstr "在手动油门模式下，使用实际空速（或估算值）来激活襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:28 324d389e2d9f444480ec01d5a1f227d7
msgid ""
"In auto-throttle modes the minimum of target airspeed and actual airspeed is"
" used"
msgstr "在自动油门模式下，使用目标空速与实际空速中的较小值"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:30 82aee6aa65614cc29b47eb39d0ac27b4
msgid ""
"This allows for auto flaps in manual throttle modes, and when speed drops in"
" an un-commanded fashion in auto-throttle modes. This needs to be used with "
"caution and carefully tested on an aircraft as it could result in an "
"oscillation, as adding flaps can change the airspeed."
msgstr ""
"这样可在手动油门模式下实现自动襟翼，并在自动油门模式下速度非指令性下降时也能起作用。此功能需谨慎使用并在飞机上仔细测试，因为放襟翼会改变空速，可能导致振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:32 7f0bad99ea5b4d89b86bd9c686141ead
msgid "Flaps can be configured on any channel."
msgstr "襟翼可配置在任意通道上。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:35 26bd0eb35d8b48bb85a093ea18622448
msgid "Software configuration"
msgstr "软件配置"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:37 22ff887c0b55485fbd3855e0532f3779
msgid ""
"The first step in setting up flaps is to set the parameter for the channel "
"function for the channel you are using for flaps to a value of 3. For "
"example, if you have flaps on channel 5 then set "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` to 3."
msgstr ""
"设置襟翼的第一步是将您用于襟翼的通道的通道功能参数设置为3。例如，如果您的襟翼在通道5，则将 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 设置为3。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:42 1f43ae496d054065984174158f418dbe
msgid ""
"Next set the parameters for your two flap speeds and flap values. These "
"parameters are :ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>`, :ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED<FLAP_1_SPEED>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>`"
msgstr ""
"接下来设置两个襟翼速度和襟翼值的参数。这些参数为 "
":ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED<FLAP_1_SPEED>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:45 c872d9679b63452b9bc7cc4fd824c81a
msgid ""
"Redo your radio calibration. Be sure to set the flap switch to the zero flap"
" position before finishing the radio calibration so that zero flaps is "
"stored as the trim (default) position."
msgstr "重新进行遥控校准。完成遥控校准前，请确保将襟翼开关拨到零襟翼位置，以便将零襟翼存储为微调（默认）位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:49 e345dd853ce24e6aa0afce3ce28658da
msgid ""
"That is basically all the setup required for speed/manual controlled flaps. "
"If you find that your flaps are moving backwards from what you expect, "
"change the reversing parameter for your flap channel, for example "
":ref:`SERVO5_REVERSED<SERVO5_REVERSED>`. Set it to 1 to reverse the flaps, "
"set to 0 for normal operation."
msgstr ""
"以上基本上就是速度/手动控制襟翼所需的全部设置。如果您发现襟翼运动方向与预期相反，请更改襟翼通道的反向参数，例如 "
":ref:`SERVO5_REVERSED<SERVO5_REVERSED>`。将其设置为1可反转襟翼，设置为0则正常运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:55 b644fbde67dc42bda5646d631085326b
msgid ""
"In addition, you can independently have flap positions for automatic "
"takeoffs and/:or landings using:"
msgstr "此外，您还可以单独设置自动起飞和/或降落时的襟翼位置，使用："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:57 bedc4088880e4e42b15338e9335c6ede
msgid ":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>`"
msgstr ":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:58 cab2b7c6e8be4c94ad6172d8cc90e377
msgid ":ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:61 bdb9005183044cbfb0226b4cec57909b
msgid "Using flaps"
msgstr "使用襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:63 550119e639da4f678118fe2ea9985d82
msgid ""
"In Manual, Stabilize, or FBW-A modes your flaps will operate manually and "
"you can set them with your transmitter."
msgstr "在 Manual、Stabilize 或 FBW-A 模式下，您的襟翼将手动操作，可通过遥控器进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:66 aa179126651f44228787f847f1cc7dd8
msgid ""
"In FBW-B the target airspeed is set by the position of the throttle stick. "
"If set up properly you should see flaps deploy as you lower the throttle "
"stick through the two flap airspeed ranges."
msgstr "在 FBW-B 模式下，目标空速由油门摇杆的位置决定。如果设置正确，当您将油门摇杆降低到两个襟翼空速范围内时，应能看到襟翼展开。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:70 6cb01ca1f1564132b3283c5d9c550606
msgid ""
"In RTL, Guided, and Auto modes flaps settings are determined by the schedule"
" in your parameters and the current value of cruise_speed. You can change "
"cruise_speed to a value in one of the flap ranges from the GCS and should "
"see the flaps deploy. Also, if you use the Do_Change_Speed command in "
"mission flaps will be deployed when the target speed is changed into one of "
"the flap speed ranges."
msgstr ""
"在 RTL、Guided 和 Auto 模式下，襟翼设置由参数中的时间表和 cruise_speed 的当前值决定。您可以通过 GCS 将 "
"cruise_speed 更改为某个襟翼速度范围内的值，并应能看到襟翼展开。此外，如果您在任务中使用 Do_Change_Speed "
"命令，当目标速度更改至某个襟翼速度范围时，襟翼将展开。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:78 c5f28c46fd0940bfbf66828e47354702
msgid "Using Flaperons"
msgstr "使用副翼襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:80 299c823dae12454e9dca6054f6690adc
msgid ""
"You can also setup flaperons. Please see the separate :ref:`flaperon guide "
"<flaperons-on-plane>` for details."
msgstr "您也可以设置副翼襟翼。详情请参阅单独的 :ref:`副翼襟翼指南 <flaperons-on-plane>`。"

